# Model card for tsync2 (medium)

* Language: th_TH (Thai, Thailand)
* Speakers: 1
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dubbing-ai/vaja-thai (`tsync2` config)
* License: CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (**non-commercial**)
* Original corpus: NECTEC TSync2, "An Intensive Design of a Thai Speech Synthesis Corpus" (SNLP 2007)

## Training

Finetuned from the U.S. English hifi_tts_92 base model (medium quality; the voice of Cori Samuel, Hi-Fi TTS reader 92), with MRD and SDP.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.5 and noise_w 0.333.

Requires Piper 1.8.0 or higher (Thai phonemizer).
